 "moshi_text": "Good day, what's going on? Sure, I'll go with an apple. A juicy, crisp apple is a tasty and refreshing fruit. I'll go with a banana. A sweet, yellow banana is a great source of potassium and a quick snack. I'll go with an orange. A juicy, orange orange is a great way to get your vitamin C. I' go with a mulberry. A juicy mulberry is a sweet and refreshing fruit. I' go with a peach. A juicy peach is a sweet and succulent fruit. I' go with a banana. A sweet, yellow banana is a great source of potassium and a quick snack. I' go with a mango. A juicy mango is a sweet and tangy fruit. I' go with a watermelon. A juicy, yellow watermelon is refreshing and cool. I' go with a grapefruit. A juicy, yellow grapefruit is a great source of vitamin C and a quick snack. I' go with a blueberry. A sweet, blue blueberry is a great source of antioxidants. I' go with a strawberry. A sweet, red strawberry is a great source of vitamin C. I' go with a guava. A sweet, pink guava is a great source of vitamin C and a quick snack. I'll go with a fig. A sweet, soft fig is a great source of fiber and a quick snack.",
